<title>AUSTRALIA: SOCCER-AUSTRALIA BEAT SOLOMON ISLANDS 13-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AUSTRALIA BEAT SOLOMON ISLANDS 13-0.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat Solomon Islands</p>
<p>13-0 (halftime 4-0) in an Oceania group one second round World</p>
<p>Cup qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Damian Mori 2, 15, 37, 55, 82, John Aloisi 34, 54,</p>
<p>83, 88, 89, Craig Foster 69, Ernie Tapai 80, Mark Bosnich 90.</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,127</p>
</text>
